# Slice R6 / R6-2 (1): an initializer expression makes a computed declaration -- by the common body construction a
# statement of the body, its output no field (K03 RECEIVE-OUTPUT) -- and a body statement is not built yet: refused here.
Model:
    size_t: x 1U
end: Model

R: merge: Model
    int: w 2 + 2
end: merge
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 0; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
